+
+PHASE4_PERF_REVIEW_PROMPT = """# Phase 4: Performance and final review
+1. Generate a maximum-size input that satisfies the constraints (outside the repository) and run the solution with `timeout 10`. If it is too slow, optimize the algorithm (not just micro-optimizations) and re-test for correctness against the sample tests.
